<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus t-bill yield falls to 5.89 percent.</title>
<headline>Cyprus t-bill yield falls to 5.89 percent.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus central bank said the average yield of a reverse repo auction of five-day treasury bills on Friday was 5.89 percent, down 16 basis points from the average yield on nine day t-bills sold at the last auction on October 15.</p>
<p>Commercial banks' bids totalled 27 million pounds for the 10.0 million pounds of bills on offer.</p>
<p>-- Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
</text>
